        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "value": "This project called for front and back covers for the Scarborough Charter’s annual committee report in a standard 8.5 × 11-inch format. The design needed to reflect the Charter’s commitments to Black flourishing, inclusive excellence, mutuality, and institutional accountability: clear, professional, and suited to a formal publication."
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
